/S /P
/E (The development of rooftop PV systems has been a significant area of research in renewable energy engineering. Numerous studies and technical reports emphasize the importance of distributed solar generation as a means to enhance energy security and reduce greenhouse gas emissions.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
