/K [4]
>>
endobj
342 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (According to the International Renewable Energy Agency \(IRENA\), rooftop PV systems accounted for nearly 25% of all installed solar capacity worldwide in 2023. Research demonstrates that small-scale PV systems in urban areas can offset up to 40% of household or institutional electricity demand.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
343 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Studies such as Tse et al. \(2005\) and Samarakoon et al. \(2013\) have established the mathematical frameworks for assessing distributed generation systems, optimizing both performance and grid stability. These works laid the foundation for integrating solar PV systems into existing electricity networks while maintaining voltage and frequency stability.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
