>>
endobj
486 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E ( Combining the PV system with other renewable sources such as small wind turbines or fuel-cell backup could further stabilize the supply and reduce intermittency, especially in variable weather conditions.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
487 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (3. IoT-Based Monitoring and Control:)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
488 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E ( Implementing an Internet of Things \(IoT\) platform for real-time monitoring, fault detection, and predictive maintenance would improve long-term reliability. Such systems can log detailed operational data for future performance optimization.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
489 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (4. Detailed Sensitivity and Risk Analysis:)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
490 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Conducting a more comprehensive sensitivity study that examines the impact of fluctuating component prices, varying electricity tariffs, inflation rates, and government incentives would provide a deeper understanding of financial risks and opportunities.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [10]
>>
